✨ 3rd Annual Breakfast for Dinner with Santa 🎅🏽🧸✨

Our 3rd Annual Breakfast for Dinner with Santa was truly amazing! We shared an evening filled with great food, fun, laughter, and Santa spreading joy by giving out toys to our little ones.

This is our way of saying thank you to our community for the continued love and support. IHOP Broad Street does it best!

A huge THANK YOU to everyone who helped make this event possible 
@rasjbaraka 
