CLOSE PROXIMITY is a London-based duo formed by Frank Brady and Demack, who brought their solo projects together after realising they were chasing the same musical direction. Their sound pulls from progressive house, proto house, trance and techno, with a nod to artists like Underworld.

Since launching at the end of 2024, they have been shaping the project with a strong run of releases planned throughout 2025. Their tracks have already appeared on labels including Dischi Autunno, Belters 4U, Italo Moderni, MINITEL, Volition,  and Cold Transmission, marking an exciting start and growing support for the duo.

@closeproximity__ will join @arvint.nyc and @andi80s all night long this Thursday, December 4th, at @bossanovacivicclub - free before 11 🫨

