@BeardFoundation-winning, @50BestBars' @MaisonPremiere is full-on old world New Orleans in the heart of Williamsburg. It's been a pioneering Brooklyn craft cocktail bar since @joshua.boissy and Krystof Zizka opened it in 2011 — but has remained one of NY’s best, with seafood towers, caviar service, crudo and oysters, extensive absinthe and sherry (hell, YES), blessed absinthe cocktails and an excellent French wine selection. 

Have I raved enough? I can't. That's why this longtimer remains one of my top NYC bars... in my Distiller Magazine guide: 

